section Compact_Selection80791
/-! T/B selection and A/B/T divisor caps for error 80791.
Adapted from jsign PR506 and the promoted quotient obstruction. -/
set_option Elab.async false
namespace ProximityPrize.SubmissionLower.Lower80791.Selection
open ProximityPrize.Benchmark RCN100 RCN119 RCN101 RCN180 RCN181 RCN137 RCN183
noncomputable section
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 5000000
